{"id":"n15601-1-8","stage":5,"title":"손수 · 亲手","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15601-1-8-1","ko":"이거 제가 직접 만든 가방인데, 선물로 드릴게요.","zh":"这是我自己亲手做的包，送给您当礼物吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만든","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가방인데,","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/403afe75559a08a54842.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15601-1-8-2","ko":"아니, 이걸 손수 만드셨다고요? 고맙습니다. 잘 쓸게요.","zh":"啊，您是亲自制作的吗？太感谢了，我会好好使用的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"啊，唷，呀","explanation":"아니：啊，唷，呀","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"2","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이걸","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손수","meaning":"亲手","explanation":"손수：亲手","readings":[{"term":"손수","audio":"/audio/4b533ac0cf8566398e23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15601","senseId":"1","lemma":"손수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만드셨다고요?","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고맙습니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸게요.","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"啊，唷，呀","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于表示感到惊讶、赞叹，或感到怀疑、奇怪。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"4b533ac0cf856639","term":"손수","zh":"亲手","audio":"/audio/4b533ac0cf8566398e23.mp3","entryId":"15601","definition":"不借助别人的帮助，用自己的手亲自。","pronunciation":["손수"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/111881d9c7127acc2922.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.737,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15601","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是我自己亲手做的包，送给您当礼物吧。","啊，您是亲自制作的吗？太感谢了，我会好好使用的。","身体有没有出现什么异常变化呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是我自己亲手做的包，送给您当礼物吧。","啊，您是亲自制作的吗？太感谢了，我会好好使用的。","身体有没有出现什么异常变化呢？"],"answer":1}]}
